# Protomaps hosted-API key. Set this to build the app AGAINST the hosted basemap
# (api.protomaps.com) instead of the local world/slovakia PMTiles — needed for a
# GitHub Pages deploy, since slovakia.pmtiles (612 MB) exceeds the 100 MB cap.
#
# Get a key at https://protomaps.com/api (free for non-commercial use). The key
# is embedded in the client bundle (like any web map key) — restrict it by
# referrer/domain in the Protomaps dashboard.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (or `.env.local`) and fill it in. When it is ABSENT,
# `npm run dev` / `npm run build` fall back to the self-hosted local PMTiles.
VITE_PROTOMAPS_KEY=
